nfigured` 初始 Profile；CLI prompt 仍保持现有显式配置要求。Remote systemd 同时固定持久数据目录和工作区，不把版本目录变成状态源。","startedSeq":4524,"endedSeq":4595,"startedAt":"1788579738Z","endedAt":"1788579740Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5606,"revision":4595,"observedAt":"1788579740Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788578588Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788579740Z","paused":false,"reason":"active","stateSnapshot":{"elapsedSeconds":4454,"activeTurnStartedAt":1788578588,"activeTurnLastActivityAt":1788579740,"revision":4595,"sawTurn":true,"pendingPermissionIds":[],"pendingElicitationIds":[],"userWaitStartedAt":null,"userWaitSeconds":0}},"raw":{"sessionUpdate":"agent_message_chunk","content":{"type":"text","text":"。"},"messageId":"resp_0b6cec828fbe2569016a9b8f7f61f887d097ec0a8a3416a426","_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","launchedAgentExecutionId":null,"toolName":null,"toolOutput":null}}}},{"id":"activity-4597","seq":4597,"timestamp":"1788579740Z","kind":"activitySummary","startedSeq":4597,"endedSeq":4651,"startedAt":"1788579740Z","endedAt":"1788579810Z","raw":{"goldBandActivity":{"activityStartSeq":4597,"activityEndSeq":4651,"totalEventCount":8,"toolCallCount":7,"thoughtCount":1,"errorCount":0,"readFileCount":0,"writtenFileCount":3,"detailAvailable":true}}},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_04d5dc92c59f431a016a9b8fdce76887d09a0ecccd9c821dd4","seq":4779,"timestamp":"1788579810Z","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","content":"Host clean启动已通过，Remote user service 也固定了持久数据目录与工作区。接下来修复配对的事实源问题：当前 `HostDeviceRegistry` 每次启动重建 Host key 和设备表，会使已配对设备在 Host 重启后失效。Stage 4 仅需要本地/SSH bootstrap 配对与重启稳定性；不会实现 Stage 5 的 Relay、角色提升、多 Client 或 Noise challenge-response。先检查现有 Host 持久化扩展点，再用同一 TCK 固定 Host identity 与设备记录跨重启不变。","startedSeq":4652,"endedSeq":4779,"startedAt":"1788579810Z","endedAt":"1788579812Z","timing":{"sessionElapsedSeconds":5678,"revision":4779,"observedAt":"1788579812Z","activeTurnStartedAt":"1788578588Z","activeTurnLastActivityAt":"1788579812Z","paused":fal